{"version":1,"page":{"kind":"annotation-detail","href":"/shijing/annotation/119-di-du/fangyurun-yuanshi","dataHref":"/__data/shijing/annotation/119-di-du/fangyurun-yuanshi/data.json","title":"诗经原始(上下) · 杕杜 · 注释总览","description":"風 · 唐風 · 杕杜 · 汇集《诗经原始(上下)》关于《杕杜》的 4 条注释，含 4 条注脚。"},"payload":{"detail":{"route":{"poemId":"119-di-du","materialId":"fangyurun-yuanshi"},"href":"/shijing/annotation/119-di-du/fangyurun-yuanshi","poem":{"id":"119-di-du","title":"杕杜","categoryId":"feng","subcategoryId":"tangfeng","path":["風","唐風","杕杜"],"segments":[{"id":"seg-001","text":"有杕之杜","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-002","text":"其葉湑湑","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-003","text":"獨行踽踽","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-004","text":"豈無他人","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-005","text":"不如我同父","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-006","text":"嗟行之人","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-007","text":"胡不比焉","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-008","text":"人無兄弟","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-009","text":"胡不佽焉","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-010","text":"有杕之杜","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-011","text":"其葉菁菁","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-012","text":"獨行睘睘","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-013","text":"豈無他人","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-014","text":"不如我同姓","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-015","text":"嗟行之人","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-016","text":"胡不比焉","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-017","text":"人無兄弟","isActive":false},{"id":"seg-018","text":"胡不佽焉","isActive":false}]},"material":{"id":"fangyurun-yuanshi","title":"诗经原始(上下)","authors":["方玉润","李先耕"],"contributorLine":"清 · 方玉润、李先耕","era":"清","publicationYear":1986,"carrier":"EPUB"},"stats":{"annotationCount":4,"glossCount":4},"annotations":[{"id":"0001","order":1,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"自傷兄弟失好而無助也。","targetNotes":"篇首题注。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 篇首题注。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0001-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"题注"}]},{"id":"0002","order":2,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"右《杕杜》二章，章九句。姚氏際恒云：「此似不得於兄弟而終望兄弟比助之辭。言我獨行無偶，豈無他人可共行乎？然終不如我兄弟也。使他人而苟如兄弟也，則嗟彼行道之人胡不親比我，而人無兄弟者胡不佽助我乎？『行之人』即上『他人』，以見他人莫如我兄弟也，即《常棣》『凡今之人，莫如兄弟』之意。」解此詩者，義止於是，不可别生枝節。如《大序》所云「君不能親其宗族，骨肉離散，獨居而無兄弟，將爲沃所并」，徒形附會而無當詩意。《集傳》不用《序》言，是矣。而釋詩語氣，又多不合。如詩言「不如我同父」，明明是有兄弟人語。而《傳》乃曰「自傷孤特」之類，與經乖反，豈能信從？愚故舍彼而録姚説，不復更爲之詞也。","targetNotes":"总评原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 总评段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0002-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"总评"}]},{"id":"0003","order":3,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"杕特也。杜赤棠也。湑湑盛貌。踽踽無所親之貌。比輔也。佽助也。菁菁亦盛貌。睘睘無所依貌。〔曹氏粹中曰〕《説文》云：「睘睘，驚視也。」獨行多懼，故睘睘也。","targetNotes":"集释原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 集释段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0003-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"集釋"}]},{"id":"0004","order":4,"total":4,"layer":"global","layerLabel":"全篇总说","targetText":"湑六語。踽七麌。父同。通韻。比四寘。佽同。本韻。菁八庚。睘同。姓二十四敬，叶桑經反。叶韻。","targetNotes":"标韵原文。","sourceLabel":null,"sourceNotes":"对应 EPUB item 标韵段。","notes":null,"glosses":[{"key":"0004-1","attributionLabel":"方玉润","sectionLabel":"標韻"}]}]}}}
